before:
Complete local PHP example; the app itself does not execute it:
```php
<?php
try {
    throw new RuntimeException("missing");
    echo "inside\n";
} catch (RuntimeException $error) {
    echo "caught\n";
} finally {
    echo "cleanup\n";
}

```

